{
  "_comment": "Converted from StormATC data/flightchecklists/a320-neo.json (Airbus A320neo). Verification steps keep their challenge and note rather than a guessed simvar check. The source flattened every flight phase into one list; items from engine start onward are deliberately not kept in preflight, so the correct class phase cards own them.",
